{"releases":[{"id":"tic-tac-twelve-oclock","name":"TIC-TAC: Twelve o'clock","releaseDate":"2026-08-19","releaseDateLabel":"Aug 19, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/tic-tac-twelve-oclock/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/tic-tac-twelve-oclock.jpg","summary":"TIC-TAC: Twelve o'clock is inspired by cult horrors of the early '90s. You have to help a group of schoolchildren-adventurers solve the abandoned school's dark mystery.\n\nYou'll spend a few nights in the oppressive atmosphere of the gloomy deserted corridors and classrooms. Carefully monitor the safety of your shelter, solving puzzles and responding to the challenge of otherworldly forces. Counter your wit and haste with frightening surprises. And finally, try to find out what caused the transformation of an ordinary school in a quiet small town into a realm of cruelty, pain, and suffering.\nciting elaborate story.\n\nYour vigilance and attentiveness will be tested by unexpected challenges of the original game mechanic and sudden attacks of creepy creatures. And for every night you survive you'll be rewarded with story advancement and new challenges.","platform":"xbox-series-x"},{"id":"hyper-primate","name":"HYPER PRIMATE","releaseDate":"2026-08-19","releaseDateLabel":"Aug 19, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/hyper-primate/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/hyper-primate.jpg","platform":"xbox-series-x"},{"id":"cosette-the-untitled-game","name":"COSETTE: THE UNTITLED GAME","releaseDate":"2026-08-19","releaseDateLabel":"Aug 19, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/cosette-the-untitled-game/","imageUrl":"https://cdn2.steamgriddb.com/grid/25c943bcecaa5cfc617b1cada7ffe484.jpg","platform":"xbox-series-x"},{"id":"money-trails","name":"Money Trails","releaseDate":"2026-08-19","releaseDateLabel":"Aug 19, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/money-trails/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/money-trails.jpg","platform":"xbox-series-x"},{"id":"wild-ice","name":"Wild Ice","releaseDate":"2026-08-19","releas